 "source": "Linux route1 stack (tools/route1/linux) with the S003 server patch: /__r1/s003?threads=N stubs localThreadCatalog with N synthetic threads, /__r1/s003-notify pushes app-server notifications",
 "notes": [
  "RS-057: the Projects header click flips aria-expanded and removes the `No projects` row; Recents moves up.",
  "RS-103: `thread/status/changed` active shows the `Working` spinner (icon-xs, text/70, animate-spin) in a 20 px box at the row's end; the title clip loses 28 px; the spinner is hidden on hover where the actions show. No error icon reaches the row from a failed turn (the unread dot wins).",
  "RS-102: `turn/completed` on a thread that is not open marks it unread: 8 px bg-info-solid dot at top 11 / right 14, hidden on hover. Opening the thread clears it.",
  "RS-104: every Home sidebar list hides the row timestamp (flat chats rowOptions hideTimestamp: true, project groups hideThreadTimestamps: true, unified sidebar hideTimestamp: true): no timestamp text in any row at rest.",
  "RS-066: Recents (last section) pages in `infiniteScroll` mode: 10 rows, +10 whenever the end sentinel is in view (once at load, the sentinel being visible), readPage limit 10 -> 20 -> 30. The `Show more` button exists only when Recents is not the last section; `Show less` only in custom sections."
 ],
